Package: exynos-loke-rescue
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, udev
Recommends: tshark, lz4
Description: Deterministic Linux firmware recovery engine for Samsung Exynos SoCs
 Exynos LOKE Rescue is a memory-safe, clean-room protocol driver and partition
 recovery engine designed specifically for Samsung Exynos devices. It directly
 interfaces with the Odin/LOKE USB endpoints (04e8:685d), bypassing Heimdall
 protocol hangs and samloader-rs dynamic super partition crashes.
